Package: corewatch
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: modern system monitor for Linux
 Corewatch is a native system monitor built with GTK 4 and libadwaita. It
 shows live graphs for the processor, memory, graphics, disks and battery,
 and follows the system light and dark style.
